{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"CurrentValueSubject"}],"externalID":"s:7Afluent19CurrentValueSubjectC","modules":[{"name":"Afluent"}],"role":"symbol","title":"CurrentValueSubject","roleHeading":"Class","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CurrentValueSubject","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Afluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject.swift#L38","fileName":"CurrentValueSubject.swift"},"symbolKind":"class"},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/Iterator"],"title":"Structures","anchor":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/init()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/init(_:)"],"title":"Initializers","anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/value"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/makeAsyncIterator()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/send()","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/send(_:)","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/send(completion:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/Completion"],"title":"Enumerations","anchor":"Enumerations"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/AsyncSequence-Implementations","doc:\/\/Afluent\/documentation\/Afluent\/CurrentValueSubject\/AsyncSequence-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths